## How work is organized in this matter

| Subfolder | Holds |
|---|---|
| `01-Pleadings/` | Complaints, answers, amended pleadings |
| `02-Discovery/` | Served and received discovery; logged in [DISCOVERY-LOG.md](DISCOVERY-LOG.md) |
| `03-Motions/` | Motions filed and received; logged in [MOTIONS-LOG.md](MOTIONS-LOG.md) |
| `04-Correspondence/` | Letters and emails (client, opposing counsel, court) |
| `05-Records/` | Medical, financial, business records (production-quality copies) |
| `06-Depositions/` | Deposition transcripts and summaries |
| `07-Exhibits/` | Exhibits prepared for hearings or trial |
| `08-Notes/` | Durable file notes (calls, meetings, court appearances) |

